        "name": "Completeness",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "All five workflows got a deliberate trigger decision, and the required `unit-tests` check uses the one shape that works: a single workflow with no workflow-level paths or paths-ignore and no companion skip workflow, where a computed `changes` step output gates every real step with an `if:` so the job still reports success when nothing relevant changed."
